  "notes": [
    "Census-fixed draft (2026-10-24, PREP-STRATHOLME-LIVE-2026-10-24.md): spawns from tools/dungeongen/testdata/map329 and the world base. Still not mapped and not live-checked: run the GM-invisible mapping walk (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0) before the first run; dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "Faction 7 is neutral (Spectral Citizen 10384, Ghostly Citizen 10385, Hearthsinger Forresten 10558): the draft's 16 citizens left every pull (two groups were only citizens) and 10558 stays in the leg skip lists. Balzaphon 14684 is a Scourge Invasion event spawn (event 81, start/end 0000-00-00, the Scorn case) and never spawns: dropped.",
    "Skul 10393 (rare, hostile, Arcane Bolt/Frost Shock/Frostbolt) stands 2.6 yd from the pull at 3509.6 -3316.1: listed in that group (the skip list is no row, and the run leader would pull him anyway).",
    "Radii are the farthest member from the pull's centroid plus 0.5 yd (plus 5 when a member wanders), floor 5: the exporter's farthest+10 reached the next pack of the same entries on 12 pulls.",
    "Jarien 16101 and Sothos 16102 stand 16.9 yd from Dathrohan (detection 20): their one-pull leg is gone and the boss lists them as first. Dathrohan turns into Balnazzar (10813, level 62, 31080 hp) below 40% and on death summons 32 skeletons at eight fixed points.",
    "The Galford hall packs (11043/10425/10424 at 3483 -3081 and 3467 -3070, 3x10424/10425 at 3439 -3090) are the last three pulls of leg 0: two of them stand 18-19.6 yd from Galford and his fight follows them by design.",
    "Malor the Zealous 11032 (17094 hp, Lay on Hands) is a single pull, but the 5-skeleton pack before it stands 19.8 yd from him and his detection is 20: expect him in that fight.",
    "Leg 0 groups 8-12 are one pile: the lone Patchwork Horror 10414 and the lone Plague Ghoul 10405 stand inside the 8-unit pack at 3509 -3319 (0.7-7.1 yd): the first of those pulls brings the pile. The mapping walk picks the stands.",
    "Untracked adds, no spawn row to list: the Eye of Naxxramas 10411's gargoyles (spell 16380) on aggro; Willey's Crimson Riflemen 11054 (one every 10 s from nine fixed points) and his gate 175969 (closed on aggro, open on death); a Crimson Initiate's Gallant 10424 at 3593.44 -3086.3 and a Gallant's/Battle Mage's Monk 11043 at 3434.52 -3064.54 on group death; Dathrohan's 32 skeletons; the rat trap's thirty plagued critters.",
    "Doors: the gate-trap portcullises 175350/175351 (open, closed 20 s by the rat trap) and Willey's 175969; the three GO_FLAG_LOCKED live-side doors with no script (The Bastion Door 175967 at 3645.56 -3136.76, Hall of the High Command 176194 at 3541.94 -3068.55 under group 29, Hoard Door 175968 at 3567.34 -3050.77) carry DB state 1 like every SM/Deadmines/SFK door the live runs walked through; the mapping walk checks the Bastion Door first.",
    "Patrols: the draft lists no patrol blocks; 21 movement-type-2 spawns exist, most of them the single-member pulls (leg 0 groups 8, 10, 11, 13, 18, 19, 24, 26, 27, 30, 33; leg 2 groups 5, 6). The run leader's rows cannot carry the path; the driver meets them where they stand.",
    "Needs (not in the plan): Postmaster Malown's summon, Timmy the Cruel, Ysida's cage and the 45-minute Baron run, the Service entrance and the Slaughter Square gate (undead side); live side of map 329 (left entrance 2217 is equivalent); Baron Rivendare is stratholme_undead."
  ],
